   "en": {
    "headline": "OpenAI launches GPT-6.1 Terra, a model built for fast computer use",
    "summary_short": "OpenAI introduces GPT-6.1 Terra, a model focused on operating a computer the way a person would. Its goal is to bring that fast, capable use to everyone.",
    "summary_long": "OpenAI has launched GPT-6.1 Terra. Its announcement sums it up in one idea: bringing fast and capable computer use to everyone. “Computer use” is a model's ability to operate programs and websites on its own: clicking, typing and browsing.\n\nThe model already has its page in the developer API documentation. The available sources do not detail prices or benchmark results. The launch sparked a wide discussion on Hacker News, with more than 350 comments.",
